config MILLET
	tristate "Sew millet: smart frozen control subsystem (dada OS4 port)"
	default n
	help
	  Port of the Xiaomi dada OS4 millet freeze chain: millet_core
	  (hook-slot bus types 1..6 + uid hash tables + netlink unit 31
	  server with the OS4 tier/cmd protocol + /proc/millet nodes) plus
	  the sig (type 1 signal sniffer), hs (type 6 handshake), pkg
	  (type 5 netfilter sniffer, exports find_and_clear_piduid) and
	  oem_cgroup (freezer can_attach gatekeeper) sensors. Includes a
	  binder-freeze preemption observer re-implemented on the public
	  android_vh_binder hooks with the in-tree frozen() predicate
	  (the closed binder_gki exports cannot be ported).  All switches
	  default off (millet_freeze_switch=0).  Module-only (needs
	  vendor-conflict review before any built-in): do NOT set =y
	  while the vendor millet ko may still load.
